@startuml activity
title Smart Customer Service & Knowledge Base System - Request Processing Activity
' Veiklos diagrama: užklausos apdorojimo eiga su sprendimų taškais.

start
:Customer submits question via ChatUI;
:Validate and sanitize input;
if (Intent classified with\nconfidence >= threshold?) then (yes)
  :IntentClassifier returns Intent;
else (no)
  :Fall back to general FAQ intent;
endif
:RAGRetriever searches KnowledgeBase (top-K);
if (Relevant documents found?) then (yes)
  :AnswerGenerator builds prompt\n(question + retrieved context);
  :LLMClient calls Gemini API;
  :Post-check answer (grounded in context?);
  if (Answer passes quality check?) then (yes)
    :Return answer with source references;
  else (no)
    :EscalationService creates ticket;
    :Notify human Support Agent;
  endif
else (no)
  :EscalationService creates ticket;
  :Notify human Support Agent;
endif
:AnalyticsLogger logs interaction\n(intent, latency, outcome);
:Display result to Customer;
stop
@enduml
